usage: python -m athis_autopilot.cli [-h] [--root ROOT]
                                     {start,demo,resume,status,doctor,login}
                                     ...

ATHIS DEV AUTOPILOT V1

positional arguments:
  {start,demo,resume,status,doctor,login}
    start               New autonomous job from a product specification
    demo                Offline red -> green demonstration using deterministic
                        mock
    resume              Resume an existing job from SQLite
    status              Inspect persistent job state
    doctor              Check prerequisites; does not run model turns
    login               Authenticate official Codex SDK using ChatGPT

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT           Runtime, state, evidence location
